"P1934009355" "T33ch@h'Z p3t"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4244101394" "{VillainName}, huh? <em>Beating scum like that has got to be worth extra credit!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1601080210" "You can't beat me! <em>Miss Francine gave me 3 gold stars!"

